# Open Persona on Hetzner: where alerts go besides the on-box marker (bin/alert.sh).
# TEMPLATE: tokens are explained in common.env.example. Never put a real value here.
#
# Empty (the default): alerts only land in /var/lib/open-persona/alerts/ALERTS, which the
# login banner and bin/preflight.sh report. Set a command to also be told off the box;
# the alert line is "$1" inside it. Examples (the owner picks and fills one in on the box):
#   OP_ALERT_CMD='curl -fsS -m 20 -d "$1" https://ntfy.sh/<a long random topic>'
#   OP_ALERT_CMD='printf "%s\n" "$1" | mail -s "Open Persona alert" <address>'
OP_ALERT_CMD=
